es","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Thu, Aug 13, 2026 at 4:23 AM Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzk@kernel.org> wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Sat, Aug 08, 2026 at 12:37:56PM -0500, Aaron Kling wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":">     Namely:"},{"depth":1,"text":">     * Nova"},{"depth":1,"text":">     * RP6"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Nova what? This is some cut commit msg."}],"lineCount":7,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This is the same structure I used for the matching AYN commit. The\nvendor is Retroid Pocket and the product is Nova. It's marketed as the\nRetroid Pocket Nova. The vendor is listed in the subject line and I'm\nlisting the product names in the bullet list."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Signed-off-by: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> ---"},{"depth":1,"text":">  Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 7 +++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":">  1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml"},{"depth":1,"text":"> index 954be28203017..52ef669d6fe9b 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"> --- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml"},{"depth":1,"text":"> @@ -1161,6 +1161,13 @@ properties:"},{"depth":1,"text":">            - const: qcom,qcs8550"},{"depth":1,"text":">            - const: qcom,sm8550"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +      - items:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +          - enum:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +              - retroidpocket,nova"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +              - retroidpocket,rp6"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"This goes to the existing enum."}],"lineCount":20,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Ack."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"> +          - const: qcom,qcs8550"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +          - const: qcom,sm8550"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Best regards,"},{"depth":1,"text":"Krzysztof"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":6,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aaron"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260813-tuna-of-pastoral-mastery-8ca99c@quoll"},"CALHNRZ9c_+ahDALiQos+H7nWOz7HK8dOfWg3_vnkX+k4=vSp4A@mail.gmail.com":{"id":"CALHNRZ9c_+ahDALiQos+H7nWOz7HK8dOfWg3_vnkX+k4=vSp4A@mail.gmail.com","messageId":"CALHNRZ9c_+ahDALiQos+H7nWOz7HK8dOfWg3_vnkX+k4=vSp4A@mail.gmail.com","references":["20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-0-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-3-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","pgup5kvjyhz7l7rucduzlqj7hmle2lrcvso6ge34up5am3uukg@3jocblne3lvi"],"missingAncestorIds":["pgup5kvjyhz7l7rucduzlqj7hmle2lrcvso6ge34up5am3uukg@3jocblne3lvi","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-3-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-0-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Aaron Kling","address":"webgeek1234@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Dmitry Baryshkov","address":"dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T18:59:55.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T18:59:55.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH 3/4] arm64: dts: qcom: Add Retroid Pocket 6","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Thu, Aug 13, 2026 at 2:06 PM Dmitry Baryshkov\n<dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com> wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Sat, Aug 08, 2026 at 12:37:57PM -0500, Aaron Kling via B4 Relay wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> From: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> The Retroid Pocket 6 is a high-performance Android-based handheld gaming"},{"depth":1,"text":"> console powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 processor featuring a"},{"depth":1,"text":"> 5.5-inch AMOLED touchscreen."},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> This is based on the support by ROCKNIX, however their history does not"},{"depth":1,"text":"> show who the original author was, so direct attributation cannot be"},{"depth":1,"text":"> given."},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Signed-off-by: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> ---"},{"depth":1,"text":">  arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                  |   1 +"},{"depth":1,"text":">  .../boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts    | 122 +++++++++++++++++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":">  2 files changed, 123 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     vdd_disp_1v8: vdd-disp-1v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"regulator-foo"}],"lineCount":22,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"I see these are inconsistent, I missed that when pulling the support\nin. However, looking at the associated AYN series, all regulators are\nnamed foo-regulator. Using regulator-foo would make that inconsistent,\nis that really desired?"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_1v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 70 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     vdd_disp_2v8: vdd-disp-2v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_2v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 142 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     ts_avdd_3v0: regulator-ts-avdd-3v0 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"ts_avdd_3v0\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <3000000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <3000000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 144 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     ts_vddio_1v8: regulator-ts-vddio-1v8 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"ts_vddio_1v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 102 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&mdss_dsi1 {"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Out of place."}],"lineCount":47,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Oops."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"> +     status = \"disabled\";"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Isn't this a default? If so, no need to repeat it."}],"lineCount":3,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"qcs8550-ayntec-common.dtsi enables this because most of the variants\nhave a panel on this connector. So as one of the odd ones out, this\nneeds turned back off."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&i2c_hub_3 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     clock-frequency = <100000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     touchscreen@38 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"focaltech,ft5426\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             reg = <0x38>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             interrupt-parent = <&tlmm>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             interrupts = <15 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_FALLING>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             reset-gpios = <&tlmm 14 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             vcc-supply = <&ts_avdd_3v0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             iovcc-supply = <&ts_vddio_1v8>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pinctrl-0 = <&ts_p_rst_default &ts_p_int_default>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pinctrl-1 = <&ts_p_rst_sleep &ts_p_int_sleep>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pinctrl-names = \"default\", \"sleep\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             touchscreen-size-x = <1080>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             touchscreen-size-y = <1920>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             touchscreen-swapped-x-y;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&pmk8550_pwm {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&remoteproc_adsp {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/adsp.mbn\","},{"depth":1,"text":"> +                     \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/adsp_dtb.mbn\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&spk_amp_l {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/aw883xx_acf.bin\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&spk_amp_r {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/aw883xx_acf.bin\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +};"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> --"},{"depth":1,"text":"> 2.54.0"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"--"},{"depth":1,"text":"With best wishes"},{"depth":1,"text":"Dmitry"}],"lineCount":55,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aaron"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"pgup5kvjyhz7l7rucduzlqj7hmle2lrcvso6ge34up5am3uukg@3jocblne3lvi"},"CALHNRZ8U3BgQJoKiQi-yX8pT+YDdp_BE6NVK7M3v-Jwe1qh3YA@mail.gmail.com":{"id":"CALHNRZ8U3BgQJoKiQi-yX8pT+YDdp_BE6NVK7M3v-Jwe1qh3YA@mail.gmail.com","messageId":"CALHNRZ8U3BgQJoKiQi-yX8pT+YDdp_BE6NVK7M3v-Jwe1qh3YA@mail.gmail.com","references":["20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-0-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-4-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260813-private-brass-rhino-81d7a9@quoll"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260813-private-brass-rhino-81d7a9@quoll","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-4-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-0-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Aaron Kling","address":"webgeek1234@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T19:03:26.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T19:03:26.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH 4/4] arm64: dts: qcom: Add Retroid Pocket Nova","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Thu, Aug 13, 2026 at 4:24 AM Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzk@kernel.org> wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Sat, Aug 08, 2026 at 12:37:58PM -0500, Aaron Kling wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> The Retroid Pocket Nova is a high-performance Android-based handheld"},{"depth":1,"text":"> gaming console powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 processor"},{"depth":1,"text":"> featuring a 4.5-inch 4:3 AMOLED touchscreen."},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Signed-off-by: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> ---"},{"depth":1,"text":">  arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                  |   1 +"},{"depth":1,"text":">  .../boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-nova.dts   | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":">  2 files changed, 119 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile"},{"depth":1,"text":"> index 09b3c5b2d9dab..582805e89f4cb 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"> --- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile"},{"depth":1,"text":"> @@ -196,6 +196,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)   += qcs8550-aim300-aiot.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-ayntec-odin2mini.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-ayntec-odin2portal.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-ayntec-thor.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-retroidpocket-nova.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs8550-rb5gen2.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":">  dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)      += qcs9100-ride.dtb"},{"depth":1,"text":"> diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-nova.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-nova.dts"},{"depth":1,"text":"> new file mode 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"> index 0000000000000..10dabb1d51f5a"},{"depth":1,"text":"> --- /dev/null"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-nova.dts"},{"depth":1,"text":"> @@ -0,0 +1,118 @@"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +/dts-v1/;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +#include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +#include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/irq.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +#include \"qcs8550-ayntec-common.dtsi\""},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +&{/} {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     model = \"Retroid Pocket Nova\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     compatible = \"retroidpocket,nova\", \"qcom,qcs8550\", \"qcom,sm8550\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     backlight: backlight {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"pwm-backlight\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pwms = <&pmk8550_pwm 0 860000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             brightness-levels = <1023 0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             num-interpolated-steps = <1023>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             default-brightness-level = <600>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             power-supply = <&vph_pwr>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-gpios = <&pmk8550_gpios 5 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pinctrl-names = \"default\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             pinctrl-0 = <&pwm_backlight_default>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     vdd_disp_1v8: vdd-disp-1v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"So foo-regulator?"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_1v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 70 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     vdd_disp_2v8: vdd-disp-2v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_2v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-min-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             regulator-max-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             gpio = <&tlmm 142 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> +     ts_avdd_3v0: regulator-ts-avdd-3v0 {"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Or regulator-foo?"}],"lineCount":84,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Given that the associated AYN series uses foo-regulator, it makes more\nsense to me to remain consistent with that. The question has been\nraised on the RP6 patch in this series, so I will wait for a response\nthere before sending a new revision."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"Decide and also read:"},{"depth":1,"text":"https://web.git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/fixed-regulator.yaml"}],"lineCount":2,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Ack."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"Best regards,"},{"depth":1,"text":"Krzysztof"}],"lineCount":2,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aaron"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":2,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260813-private-brass-rhino-81d7a9@quoll"},"4vt23tosseomh2j6iawx5ij6hp5gycuf2okjntwp6zygw6kflt@tavh75hc7fiy":{"id":"4vt23tosseomh2j6iawx5ij6hp5gycuf2okjntwp6zygw6kflt@tavh75hc7fiy","messageId":"4vt23tosseomh2j6iawx5ij6hp5gycuf2okjntwp6zygw6kflt@tavh75hc7fiy","references":["20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-0-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","20260808-rp-qcs8550-v1-3-a5a365ba3dc5@gmail.com","pgup5kvjyhz7l7rucduzlqj7hmle2lrcvso6ge34up5am3uukg@3jocblne3lvi","CALHNRZ9c_+ahDALiQos+H7nWOz7HK8dOfWg3_vnkX+k4=vSp4A@mail.gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Dmitry Baryshkov","address":"dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Aaron Kling","address":"webgeek1234@gmail.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"},{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-15T14:44:28.000Z","iso":"2026-08-15T14:44:28.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH 3/4] arm64: dts: qcom: Add Retroid Pocket 6","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Fri, Aug 14, 2026 at 01:59:55PM -0500, Aaron Kling wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"On Thu, Aug 13, 2026 at 2:06 PM Dmitry Baryshkov"},{"depth":1,"text":"<dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com> wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> On Sat, Aug 08, 2026 at 12:37:57PM -0500, Aaron Kling via B4 Relay wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > From: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > The Retroid Pocket 6 is a high-performance Android-based handheld gaming"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > console powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 processor featuring a"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > 5.5-inch AMOLED touchscreen."},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > This is based on the support by ROCKNIX, however their history does not"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > show who the original author was, so direct attributation cannot be"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > given."},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Signed-off-by: Aaron Kling <webgeek1234@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > ---"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >  arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                  |   1 +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >  .../boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts    | 122 +++++++++++++++++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >  2 files changed, 123 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     vdd_disp_1v8: vdd-disp-1v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> regulator-foo"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"I see these are inconsistent, I missed that when pulling the support"},{"depth":1,"text":"in. However, looking at the associated AYN series, all regulators are"},{"depth":1,"text":"named foo-regulator. Using regulator-foo would make that inconsistent,"},{"depth":1,"text":"is that really desired?"}],"lineCount":29,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"I think, it's generally a better ide. Feel free to rename the regulator\nnodes in the existing DTs that you import in a spearate patch (although\nthat might get rejected by other reviewers as \"noise\")."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_1v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-min-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             gpio = <&tlmm 70 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     vdd_disp_2v8: vdd-disp-2v8-regulator {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-name = \"vdd_disp_2v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-min-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-max-microvolt = <2800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             gpio = <&tlmm 142 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     ts_avdd_3v0: regulator-ts-avdd-3v0 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-name = \"ts_avdd_3v0\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-min-microvolt = <3000000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-max-microvolt = <3000000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             gpio = <&tlmm 144 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     ts_vddio_1v8: regulator-ts-vddio-1v8 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             compatible = \"regulator-fixed\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-name = \"ts_vddio_1v8\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-min-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             gpio = <&tlmm 102 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&mdss_dsi1 {"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Out of place."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Oops."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     status = \"disabled\";"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Isn't this a default? If so, no need to repeat it."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"qcs8550-ayntec-common.dtsi enables this because most of the variants"},{"depth":1,"text":"have a panel on this connector. So as one of the odd ones out, this"},{"depth":1,"text":"needs turned back off."}],"lineCount":58,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Yep, I missed it. THanks for the pointer."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&i2c_hub_3 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     clock-frequency = <100000>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     touchscreen@38 {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             compatible = \"focaltech,ft5426\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             reg = <0x38>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             interrupt-parent = <&tlmm>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             interrupts = <15 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_FALLING>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             reset-gpios = <&tlmm 14 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             vcc-supply = <&ts_avdd_3v0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             iovcc-supply = <&ts_vddio_1v8>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             pinctrl-0 = <&ts_p_rst_default &ts_p_int_default>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             pinctrl-1 = <&ts_p_rst_sleep &ts_p_int_sleep>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             pinctrl-names = \"default\", \"sleep\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             touchscreen-size-x = <1080>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             touchscreen-size-y = <1920>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +             touchscreen-swapped-x-y;"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     };"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&pmk8550_pwm {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&remoteproc_adsp {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/adsp.mbn\","},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +                     \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/adsp_dtb.mbn\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     status = \"okay\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&spk_amp_l {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/aw883xx_acf.bin\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +&spk_amp_r {"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +     firmware-name = \"qcom/sm8550/retroidpocket/rp6/aw883xx_acf.bin\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > +};"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > --"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > 2.54.0"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> --"},{"depth":1,"text":"> With best wishes"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Dmitry"},